    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d220">

                <pb facs="0188" n="184" sameAs="frus:frus1938v04/pg184"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">811.30 Asiatic Fleet/586: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Navy Department to the Department of
                        State</hi><anchor n="42" xml:id="d220-f1"/></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">[<placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Nanking</hi></placeName>,] <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1938-09-14T21:06:00+08:00">September 14, 1938—9:06
                        p.m.</date><lb/>[Received September 15—7 a.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>0014. Admiral Oikawa reaffirms his promise to ensure <hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Monocacy</hi> coal supply and is directing Nipponese SNO<anchor n="43"
                        xml:id="d220-f2"/> Kiukiang to arrange delivery 25 tons weekly from
                    Andersen, Meyer to Standard Vacuum installation. Request <hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Monocacy</hi> check with Kondo<anchor n="44" xml:id="d220-f3"/> and advise
                    me before <hi rendition="#italic">Oahu</hi> departs Shanghai.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d220-f1" n="42" type="source" xml:id="d220-f1-content">
                <p>Copy of telegram from the commanding officer of the U. S. S. <hi
                        rendition="#italic">Oahu</hi> to the Commander of the United States Yangtze
                    Patrol.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d220-f2" n="43" xml:id="d220-f2-content">
                <p>Senior Naval Officer.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d220-f3" n="44" xml:id="d220-f3-content">
                <p>Rear Admiral Kondo, Imperial Japanese Navy.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
